@baseUrl = http://localhost:1198

### API status
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Refresh User",
  "email": "refresh-user@example.com",
  "password": "ReplaceThisWithYourOwnPassphrase2026!"
}

### Login user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "refresh-user@example.com",
  "password": "ReplaceThisWithYourOwnPassphrase2026!"
}

### Current user (access cookie required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Refresh tokens (refresh cookie required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh-token

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
